    "message": "Merge pull request #1911 from ZalithLauncher/refactor/version-encapsulate-gamepath\n\nrefactor: Version 封装游戏目录，版本链路路径由 Version 实例提供",
    "created_at": "2026-09-18T17:00:17Z",
